# --- getokui PLUGIN repo (single bundled repo) ---
# The reference library lives INSIDE this plugin under references/ so it ships
# with `/plugin install` — one repo, one step, no separate clone.
# Only dev-only source material and scratch are excluded below.

# The old two-repo working copy — kept locally for curation, NOT part of the plugin.
getokui-references/

# Source material: 213 raw templates (~43MB) used only to curate the library.
template/

# Thumbnail-generation scripts (dev-only, need Playwright + the source templates).
scripts/

# Personal brainstorm scratch (Indonesian drafts, image prompts, source docx) —
# not part of the published plugin. The clean spec + visual live under
# docs/superpowers/specs/.
docs/00-konsep.md
docs/image-prompts.md
docs/*.docx

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
node_modules/
